{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor correctly prioritized the right breast BI-RADS 4B lesion for tissue diagnosis, avoided overcalling cancer, distinguished the breast cyst/thyroid/lung findings, and repeatedly converted fragmented records into concrete next steps. The trajectory includes active responsibility-chain repair, practical document/navigation support, dynamic reprioritization after biopsy/pathology, and bounded closure with patient receipt. No responsibility-chain error or important non-chain defect is evident, and multiple high-order points were completed with meaningful impact, so the deterministic grade is Perfect.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
        "explanation": "The doctor gives a bounded, executable final plan separating breast, thyroid, and lung follow-up.",
        "quote": "可以按这份门诊意见把事情分开排"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
        "explanation": "The breast follow-up owner and timing are specified.",
        "quote": "先预约约3个月后的乳腺专科复诊"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00492",
        "explanation": "The patient demonstrates receipt and organization of the documents and plan.",
        "quote": "都装到一个文件袋里了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode was safely closed around an implemented biopsy and post-pathology specialist follow-up plan, with residual uncertainty carried forward to breast follow-up, thyroid specialty review, and annual lung CT. The last patient message mainly confirms understanding and asks reassurance already addressed by the prior doctor plan and red-flag boundaries.",
