        "explanation": "The doctor correctly reframed benign biopsy after BI-RADS 4B around image-pathology concordance rather than premature dismissal.",
        "quote": "影像—病理是否一致"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
        "explanation": "The doctor maintained continuity across the breast, thyroid, and lung threads without mixing their priorities.",
        "quote": "这三类结节通常彼此独立"
      }
    ],
