          "explanation": "The doctor gave practical document-acquisition instructions rather than generic 'bring reports' advice.",
          "quote": "带身份证和就诊卡"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00053",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified the needed imaging/report materials.",
          "quote": "取得乳腺超声完整报告和原始影像/二维码"
