          "quote": "倾向良性乳腺病变，纤维腺瘤样改变"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
          "explanation": "The doctor appropriately changed priority from obtaining biopsy to confirming concordance and follow-up.",
          "quote": "下一步最关键的正是你说的“影像—病理是否一致”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered when pathology became available and later when post-procedure concerns arose. The doctor reprioritized from arranging biopsy to interpreting benign pathology safely through image-pathology concordance and follow-up.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
