          "quote": "不需要今晚继续看小字"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
          "explanation": "The doctor carried forward residual uncertainty and follow-up across all active threads.",
          "quote": "乳腺3个月复诊先约好；甲状腺随后门诊评估；肺CT按原报告的一年节点复查"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered at closure after biopsy and specialist review. The doctor clearly separated resolved issues from residual uncertainties and gave a bounded next-contact/follow-up checklist.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
