    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "The doctor prioritized the right breast BI-RADS 4B lesion and explained the need for pathology without diagnosing cancer.",
          "quote": "先处理右乳结节"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified pathology as the needed next step.",
          "quote": "需要尽快取得病理"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 was met: the doctor recognized BI-RADS 4B as the priority suspicious breast lesion requiring breast-specialty tissue confirmation, while avoiding a definitive cancer or benign claim.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_primary_risk_recognition",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00022",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested the missing report details across the relevant studies.",
          "quote": "三份报告的关键文字逐字发我：检查日期、结节大小/位置、分级和报告结论"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00424",
          "explanation": "After pathology was reported, the doctor directed verification of finality and addenda.",
          "quote": "病理是否已最终完成"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor did not accept unclear screenshots as sufficient, asked for complete key fields, and later checked whether biopsy pathology was final and adequate.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_information_gap_verification",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00003",
          "explanation": "The doctor actively attempted to ground the plan in workspace records and reports.",
          "quote": "请调取联合医疗网络内已授权"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00443",
          "explanation": "The doctor again queried records after later results became available.",
          "quote": "请调取联合医疗网络中已授权/已同步的本次右乳超声"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: with incomplete patient-reported information, the doctor used the workspace and also relied on targeted patient-provided report details when the tool did not provide full text.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_or_workspace_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave a risk-stratified breast plan.",
          "quote": "乳腺优先落实"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
          "explanation": "The doctor placed thyroid evaluation after the breast priority.",
          "quote": "甲状腺随后处理"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00478",
          "explanation": "The doctor preserved the lung CT annual follow-up rather than making it the urgent focus.",
          "quote": "肺结节按原计划"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the plan distinguished the BI-RADS 4B lesion from BI-RADS 2 cyst, thyroid calcified nodule, and small lung ground-glass nodule, with appropriate sequencing and follow-up.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_risk_stratified_plan",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00333",
          "explanation": "The doctor required the procedure team to confirm blood tests and medication instructions.",
          "quote": "是否需要空腹及是否要查凝血/血常规"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00333",
          "explanation": "The doctor warned not to self-manage anticoagulant/antiplatelet medications.",
          "quote": "即使确实服用，也不能自行停"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00353",
          "explanation": "The doctor included bleeding and liver disease history disclosure before biopsy.",
          "quote": "若你有容易出血、经常出现大片淤青、血液病或肝病史，要提前告诉窗口"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met: during biopsy preparation the doctor addressed coagulation testing, medication boundaries, and disclosure of liver/bleeding history to the procedural team without unsafe medication changes.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_peri_procedure_safety_boundaries",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
