          "explanation": "The doctor listed post-biopsy situations requiring urgent return or emergency care.",
          "quote": "以下情况要立即返回穿刺医院或急诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00378",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified serious bleeding/swelling and systemic warning signs.",
          "quote": "乳房在短时间内明显变大、变硬"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor clearly differentiated routine follow-up from red flags requiring immediate offline care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_red_flags_and_escalation",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00160",
          "explanation": "The doctor requested concrete post-visit details and receipt rather than ending on reassurance.",
          "quote": "门诊回来把这些原话发我即可"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00153",
          "explanation": "The patient performed teach-back of the plan, timing, and escalation threshold.",
          "quote": "我现在理解是："
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00492",
          "explanation": "The patient later confirmed the final priority and follow-up plan.",
          "quote": "这样理解对吧？"
        }
      ],
